			"notes": "Added the Ice Zombie, which spawns naturally on snowy biomes or during snowing on normal biomes.\nThe Ice Zombie is immune to daylight burning for a few seconds after daylight, and can recover it's ice cube if left in the dark for long enough. Ice Zombies that still have their Ice Cube will drop it on death. Ice Zombies slow players on hit.\nAdded the Ice Spell, crafted with 1 paper and 1 Ice Block. It shoots a projectile that slow downs enemies on hit.\n\n1.5.1:\nRemoved armor rendering from Chicken Transformation\n\nRequires halplibe 4.0.6\nFor 7.2pre1"
		},
